Ah, 'tis a terrible thing when sleep won't come to ye. Sure, the mind can be a cruel companion in the dark hours. Have ye tried a tea of chamomile before bed? And I could make ye up a wee sachet of lavender and hops for under the pillow — my own mother swore by it.

