Ach, sorry to hear that about yer mother. A tea of thyme with a good spoonful of honey will ease her chest something lovely — I've a bundle dried here if she's none in the house. Tell her to keep it warm by the fire and breathe the steam through a cloth over her head. If it's not settling in a few days, send word and I'll come have a listen to her chest meself.

