Dia dhuit, and sure that's grand news! When her pains start coming regular — like every ten minutes or so — or if her waters break, that's the time to come for me. Don't be waiting too long thinking it'll pass, mind — I'd rather come early than late. And if there's bleeding or anything that frightens ye before then, come running straightaway.

